[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Copy %%ETCDIR%%/deduper.env.sample to %%ETCDIR%%/deduper.env and fill in
IMMICH_PATH, the PSQL_* credentials of the Immich database and
QDRANT_URL. Qdrant keeps the image vectors and is available as
databases/qdrant.

The web interface has no authentication and binds to every address. It
serves the originals of the library and deletes them on request, so keep
DEDUP_PORT, 8086 by default, away from untrusted networks.

Cache, models and log go to %%DBDIR%%. The first scan downloads some
230 MB of model data.
EOM
}
]
